# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command cophist
usage 1   cophist [<reg>] [<count>]     Coprocessor register history (default: all regs, last 16)

case a target that keeps none
target fake
covers 1
$ cophist
out 53
This core does not keep coprocessor register history.
status 0
action none
$ cophist R15 4
out 53
This core does not keep coprocessor register history.
status 0
action none
end

case with no target
target none
covers 1
$ cophist
out 65
Error: No ROM loaded - this command needs an active debug target.
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
end

case on venus-sa1
target venus-sa1
frames 3
covers 1
$ cophist
out 371
Coprocessor history: 1 of 1 retained (capacity 600),
unchanged for 0 refresh(es).
  refresh    CCNT    SCNT     SIE     CIE    BMAP  Halted      PB      PC       A       X       Y       S       P  ClocksRun  ClocksOffered
        0      20      00      00      00      00       1      00    0000    0000    0000    0000    01FF      34  0000000000000000  0000000000105BEA
status 0
action none
$ cophist 2
out 371
Coprocessor history: 1 of 1 retained (capacity 600),
unchanged for 0 refresh(es).
  refresh    CCNT    SCNT     SIE     CIE    BMAP  Halted      PB      PC       A       X       Y       S       P  ClocksRun  ClocksOffered
        0      20      00      00      00      00       1      00    0000    0000    0000    0000    01FF      34  0000000000000000  0000000000105BEA
status 0
action none
$ cophist R15
out 36
No coprocessor register named 'R15'.
status 0
action none
$ cophist NOPE
out 37
No coprocessor register named 'NOPE'.
status 0
action none
$ cophist 0
out 371
Coprocessor history: 1 of 1 retained (capacity 600),
unchanged for 0 refresh(es).
  refresh    CCNT    SCNT     SIE     CIE    BMAP  Halted      PB      PC       A       X       Y       S       P  ClocksRun  ClocksOffered
        0      20      00      00      00      00       1      00    0000    0000    0000    0000    01FF      34  0000000000000000  0000000000105BEA
status 0
action none
end

